{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Through the Lens</strong></i> is a narrative visual novel that blends <strong>romance, mystery, and fantasy</strong> in a unique dual storyline experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young photographer who moves to Paris for a new job at Mirage Corp \u2014 a glamorous fashion company with a darker side. Between photo shoots, intriguing coworkers, and suspicious meetings, you quickly discover that something is very wrong. Your choices shape your relationships, uncover secrets, and determine your fate \u2014 whether in love, friendship, or survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But each night when you return home, something unexpected unfolds. You discover a mysterious old book titled <i>The Legend of Ardan</i>. As you read, you are transported into a medieval world of knights, tyranny, and ancient magic, where a boy named Ardan seeks vengeance and honor after the brutal murder of his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s more unsettling? <strong>Some faces from this fantasy world look eerily familiar</strong>. Coincidence... or is the book trying to reveal something deeper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc94 Romantic routes with multiple love interests, each with unique personalities and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d A dark mystery inside Mirage Corp involving manipulation, threats, and a secret organization known as Velvet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A fully integrated second narrative: <i>The Legend of Ardan</i>, an epic medieval story of revenge, honor, and seduction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Hidden connections between both timelines that gradually unravel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Exclusive photo gallery, based on romance level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Characters who transcend their worlds \u2014 some from the past, some from the present, with unexpected consequences.<br><br>\ud83d\udfea <strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong>:</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novels with meaningful choices and multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parallel universes and fantasy lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep romance arcs and adult storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrigue, conspiracies, and supernatural elements.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Through the Lens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/956a79358756ec21fc3a650f18e1fe6a84b24158.jpg"},{"name":"Behind the Mirage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/8ec374dc608becc9e07ff49dbd7cd7b751ffb5a7.jpg"},{"name":"Shadows of Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/d63d9cc0563265bfff024b7cc61722a1017cf646.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Exposure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/f548e0b27b0957b28e782ab99fba529b7833b605.jpg"},{"name":"A Story Within a Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/61cf1b0696fc8a395e63b3006ba4511c074aa58e.jpg"},{"name":"Can\u2019t Put It Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/2eca39529d88687bcafa2de1fc0b4df66cbfce8b.jpg"},{"name":"I'm not for sale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/e7d2dff52ac5fd35661e49e3175fde03aa52b967.jpg"},{"name":"Deal with the Devil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665620/f5931375a9e2886d60c5ce6be8d441c9368c74be.jpg"},{"name":"Through Her Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s