/p></li></ul>","developers":["PiggyNose Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665620/de9cbd94bcf701db46fb16237d92b9357d6b9100/header.jpg?t=1770921698","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 750 or better, AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenGL 2, DirectX 9 or OpenGL ES 2 required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.6 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 750 or better, AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenGL 2, DirectX 9 or OpenGL ES 2 required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665620/874521801/f8fb5bbb573d0c061114f01a9740fddba0db8f28/1770921311/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770921696","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665620/874521801/f8fb5bbb573d0c061114f01a9740fddba0db8f28/1770921311/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770921696","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665620/874521801/f8fb5bbb573d0c061114f01a9740fddba0db8f28/1770921311/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770921696","id":257285828,"name":"Through the Lens - Main Girls","thumbnail":"https